---
layout: layouts/base.njk
title: Projects
description: Five software engineering projects by Rena Tokhi (CSE 134B HW5).
---
<h1>Projects</h1>
<p>
  Five projects, selected from a full review of my GitHub repos based on commit activity, completeness,
  and topical variety. They span a full-stack team capstone, a from-scratch distributed systems build,
  and framework-specific work in Angular and React.
</p>

<div class="filters">
  <span>Filter by stack (not yet wired up):</span>
  <button type="button">JavaScript</button>
  <button type="button">Java</button>
  <button type="button">Angular</button>
  <button type="button">React</button>
</div>

<section id="project-list">
  <h2 class="visually-hidden">All projects</h2>
  {%- for project in collections.projects %}
  <article>
    <img src="{{ project.data.image }}" alt="{{ project.data.imageAlt }}" width="800" height="450">
    <h2>{{ project.data.title }}{% if project.data.flagship %} <span>(Flagship Project)</span>{% endif %}</h2>
    <p>{{ project.data.description }}</p>
    <div class="tags">
      {%- for tag in project.data.stack %}<skill-tag>{{ tag }}</skill-tag>{%- endfor %}
    </div>
    <p><a href="{{ project.url }}">Read more</a> &middot; <a href="{{ project.data.github }}" target="_blank" rel="noopener">View on GitHub</a></p>
  </article>
  {%- endfor %}
</section>
